    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86036d26c9107d47ded9c5fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──呼，那好。\n我们换个地方说话吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5905bbb9d02336e6ab4934f2c5b7af528cc960a212df8edea3e6743ee26370b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1de9c97a1421f99b845b3abb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我向气槽表示我来找她，\n是想跟她谈谈今后的竞赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d90544b8c998bb6d25fb4383f76f2336bd7644ea68bfa2d09aa2fa1689a9f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84b163f2355c6a19b4a5bc3f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aeefd9351cf225be62ca348",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要走后冠路线。\n目标是──“三后冠”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "731f4e6f8116a23ead79825a2d3dba06785251c7c8fe191a3dcba9adc80158c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c10f9ab332e0e8494b29f94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽如此坚定表示，\n语气比平常更加强而有力，没有一丝犹疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee2cd7b8167bedf688b8049e5b6d576ffbb867e0bf3b2e254cc8a43d3ae08c7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7855e832a0625618a60258c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
