    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f0421ce377d766056dc5781",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错。\n……我一定会将今天的成果活用于未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e721430f25586a14737cd8fad44e2678bd9cf3a05eadd2e5cfe628a1114e6484",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5d5666e38d4e6b17dc620f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后冠路线，指的是参加\n“樱花赏”、“橡树大赛”、“秋华赏”\n这三场竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "983730d4423da7f051ddc02f233b43a8ca81a82d046941222bbd17b63571ea32",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99951e4d722e92f76155310a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每一场都是夙负盛名的GⅠ竞赛，\n只要获胜，就会留名于后世──",
      "source_fingerprint": "18dbe7f408ae21fa57b1a7058aec007ae6f297e7c12c3f91ec14a0d8b7b17341",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db1e137a78471b8dcf4b900d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而“三后冠”更是至高无上的荣耀，\n只有称霸这三场竞赛的选手才能获得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b628223bbf9ddb3c5d5fe41f3420a6ead5418af5614f22e1d1a5face016a85f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9abdcb75e5cf7df9cd394a70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
