      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7d69bdeca43de901f29a245",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而我该展现的也一样──不只是实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd093862f4f86fa3e8786a4ae8ded232615e42ba00fc52a877e2c6449fa16404",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:090c70fe9ccd0675924d07d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5126e4d1dbb96f7a0e2ae56d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要让观众为我着迷，并让所有赛马娘希望\n“变得像我这样”，让她们追寻我的身影──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb018fae93e5c038955bce53a17699b924f90fc3ab3ab7c79821775e530cb50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00cbec4dbc92e6baa8eb25b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2054e537b4c630e071357853",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这才是我该展现的理想，\n也是身为“女帝”应有的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f6e23d760594c8fe90bcadc60cae49e06eb1f6efb0936d000d0479d53034aa2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c62dd71673181c6835b259",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62f7cb5c23024eac5b08259b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此在亲身实现这个理想的过程中，\n我一定得向“三后冠”挑战。",
